"session_index":17,"source_sha256":"37235b1bf4d58efcb04f2b954a4cd78027e318ce61838127b0d878f8e32fb1b0","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":4},{"dia_id":"D17:5","global_turn_index":301,"locator":"[S17T5]","raw_turn_sha256":"761dff546973a15543db4d90f82b491bfa51a140990ded10fd2e1a04201ea101","rendered_turn_sha256":"690a3fcfd4a95e85516b4143d04a34e1d7ec384f1577b598de27a1a188a8273b","session_date":"2023-09-02","session_datetime":"2023-09-02T09:19:00","session_id":"session_17","session_index":17,"source_sha256":"893ee9960621250cb2fe9e36a6158bfbc9aa2902b71f898f2ba4fb45c7aecc61","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":5},{"dia_id":"D17:6","global_turn_index":302,"locator":"[S17T6]","raw_turn_sha256":"04f5a4055d464b8b8cdf087c0db653c7fb151d5f8c61054b2a78cdf445ca804a","rendered_turn_sha256":"baf8f68059bd17fd0c90b6ec79c86dfb8f3280ff4542797c2f57c414d2e6daa4","session_date":"2023-09-02","session_datetime":"2023-09-02T09:19:00","session_id":"session_17","session_index":17,"source_sha256":"8a7cc85d81499fecb6fdafc2b3a8ef32e2f2deb882f63c42f81db302dd8961c4","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":6}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Hey Calvin! Been a while, what's up? I'm tied up with car stuff lately, yesterday I came back from San Francsico with some great insights and knowledge on car modification that I want to share with you! Changing things around, and giving an old car a new life - so satisfying!\n[S17T1] (dia_id: D17:1)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave! Nice to hear from you. That's cool! I totally understand the satisfaction you get from fixing cars. It's like you're giving them new life.\n[S17T2] (dia_id: D17:2)\n\nDave: Yeah, it's great fixing stuff up and seeing it turn out better. It's really rewarding and gives me a sense of purpose. Plus, it feels like I'm making a difference when I fix someone's car.\n[S17T3] (dia_id: D17:3)\n\nCalvin: Wow, you must feel great making a real difference in someone's life, like being their superhero!\n[S17T4] (dia_id: D17:4)\n\nDave: Yeah, it's great! It feels really good to make a difference and see their relief when their car is fixed. Makes me proud!\n[S17T5] (dia_id: D17:5)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave, that's awesome! You should be really proud of yourself for bringing joy to others. I booked a flight ticket to Boston last week! I'm so excited about my upcoming trip to Boston. Look at this! See you soon, buddy!\n[Image caption: a photo of a book with a boarding pass and a boarding pass]\n[S17T6] (dia_id: D17:6)","text_sha256":"fb5c39a282853184e88c76df2577d2fd81e32f2ab46ffc6537fb7e5a0168f4cb","timestamp":"2023-09-02T09:19:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D19:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":27,"line_start":26,"source_locators":["[S19T5]"],"text_sha256":"699a4cfc87762337a7f695672fb612a9ce144c2c01f3b6a7ba6604553a42cadb"},{"dia_ids":["D19:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":30,"line_start":29,"source_locators":["[S19T6]"],"text_sha256":"c95c57198f14031c976bb69466234d08e3a43d61d75f366cae27f549f5a7b99f"},{"dia_ids":["D19:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":34,"line_start":32,"source_locators":["[S19T7]"],"text_sha256":"02a6080130aa5a112ded0ff46498894c8a917c6fb3b4649b748167d9a33fcaa5"},{"dia_ids":["D19:8"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":37,"line_start":36,"source_locators":["[S19T8]"],"text_sha256":"335c98ed1b5cc021689909134e75284fe40fe681734eba94a5e8bd605b804cfa"},{"dia_ids":["D19:9"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":40,"line_start":39,"source_locators":["[S19T9]"],"text_sha256":"33be34e840ce034bb5182b6979e102b36d21f59ae1cef62eed4d83e50d16480f"},{"dia_ids":["D19:10"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":43,"line_start":42,"source_locators":["[S19T10]"],"text_sha256":"859e064c342a46264f92a5db80a25d6d61467f0da1f53683aaa5e48ffbf3fbdc"},{"dia_ids":["D19:11"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":46,"line_start":45,"source_locators":["[S19T11]"],"text_sha256":"1fce7501e3ec7ab96