"rendered_turn_sha256":"1fce7501e3ec7ab968ccbef2315d058173831829fdc15e7c65dd56df21e350f8","session_date":"2023-09-15","session_datetime":"2023-09-15T00:13:00","session_id":"session_19","session_index":19,"source_sha256":"8662aa373f703051f237dac5fafac361f36aa0692ea19665f3678c5fdb04fb36","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":11},{"dia_id":"D19:12","global_turn_index":334,"locator":"[S19T12]","raw_turn_sha256":"5f3c67fd1eef3ef24ca2c22da082d2121ab5ceeead084af1ee66efb70883adf1","rendered_turn_sha256":"858ffa676f408eaf4294d2f7c98223a235508ec75bafde486116555a40fadcda","session_date":"2023-09-15","session_datetime":"2023-09-15T00:13:00","session_id":"session_19","session_index":19,"source_sha256":"b08c0b2aec1dea8f977556c05ebc841ed2696b2b6deab721acdc08f514e6ba7c","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":12}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Wow, that's a gorgeous poster! It reminds me of one of my favorite Disney movies. I love the lesson it teaches about following your dreams no matter what others say. Have you seen it yet?\n[S19T5] (dia_id: D19:5)\n\nCalvin: Thanks! Ratatouille is one of my favorites! It's all about going after what you love, no matter what anyone says. Last time we talked, you mentioned your car hobby - how's that going?\n[S19T6] (dia_id: D19:6)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It's been awesome. Been restoring this vintage beauty - here is the final result pic, take a look!\n[Image caption: a photography of a man standing next to a classic car]\n[S19T7] (dia_id: D19:7)\n\nCalvin: Nice work, Dave! That looks amazing. Is it satisfying to see your hard work pay off?\n[S19T8] (dia_id: D19:8)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It's so satisfying to see this brought back to life, especially with people's reactions when they see the finished product - makes all the hard work worth it.\n[S19T9] (dia_id: D19:9)\n\nCalvin: Dave, it's awesome seeing people happy thanks to you! Fixing cars is such an art. You're inspiring - keep up the good work!\n[S19T10] (dia_id: D19:10)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It means a lot that you appreciate what I do. I'm glad that I can make people happy and that's what I'm gonna keep doing. Got to go now, I have a lot of work to do! Take care!\n[S19T11] (dia_id: D19:11)\n\nCalvin: You're really talented, Dave. Keep making people happy and doing what you love. That's what it's all about. See you soon, have a nice one!\n[S19T12] (dia_id: D19:12)","text_sha256":"30459d6322b7ed88682d46e5663c1722aabc72f170fdf9b3295c4099561a9108","timestamp":"2023-09-15T00:13:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D6:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S6T1]"],"text_sha256":"52b0f9c57c15b61f12117d36b1871651214386fff20638706defbf033e14b7f5"},{"dia_ids":["D6:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":16,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S6T2]"],"text_sha256":"88027f0d0830b138b772f4a9c170258806d63579f0167acbc041e99355626b3a"},{"dia_ids":["D6:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":19,"line_start":18,"source_locators":["[S6T3]"],"text_sha256":"95eba2fcfad39165ac4bbc7cf8774c1bd3587f85ca3f12ee0c4978e9148d345a"},{"dia_ids":["D6:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":22,"line_start":21,"source_locators":["[S6T4]"],"text_sha256":"70aa600e6675d4f43095e014abdc137b34c4290049441e0c679c3f2b0c3007a4"},{"dia_ids":["D6:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":26,"line_start":24,"source_locators":["[S6T5]"],"text_sha256":"c80278af921493efaff2fce7d460afc2da9edd082c09cf3843fa514fe84f209c"},{"dia_ids":["D6:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":29,"line_start":28,"source_locators":["[S6T6]"],"text_sha256":"6821fbc02cf93319aa641977aa1c340924ad56754530cc9af132d77e9c59645c"},{"dia_ids":["D6:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":32,"line_start":31,"source_locators":["[S6T7]"],"text_sha256":"b2b0ab51c9f60e8376c875a9a1317b288a61756445eaa3d0283edf4deb73782b"},{"dia_ids":["D6:8"],"kind":"raw_t